     "figure": {
      "src": "/theory/figures/textbook/17_dbscan_noise.svg",
      "alt": "17 dbscan noise",
      "caption": "**Figure — 17 dbscan noise**. DBSCAN on two generated point clouds plus scattered background points. Gray marks observations that are not density-reachable under the displayed parameter choice. A different neighborhood radius or minimum count can merge clusters or mark more points as noise; colors do not establish real-world classes."
     }
